CLAUDE.md
# An editor or a script backing up the line above produces a name the line above does not
# match, so the copy escapes the rule its source obeys and lands in `git status` as a new
# file. One reached the INDEX and sat there across sessions.
CLAUDE.md.bak
CLAUDE.md.orig
prompts.md
.grimp_cache/

# Local, per-developer settings (Claude Code etc.) - never commit
*.local.json
# bitranox curated memory (local; CLAUDE.local.md @imports it)
CLAUDE.local.md

